{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_cast3_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_cast3_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"不朽","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cast3_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"21f987ca18ee85aaa472a80d987d9c88db7d5d4d826a7b122c12e60a8fd42110","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"小车个人剧情"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:29 A.M. 天气/阴"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确认环境——距离第1439号塌方位置3.79公里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扫描周围生命体——八人，隶属罗德岛工程部应急响应施工队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全等级评定为中低风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，这是个可靠的休息地点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"麻烦你了，Castle-3。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我已经坐下五分钟了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，这地方收拾得差不多了，等最前面的勘测小组发回地质报告，我们就准备继续前进了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家辛苦了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一夜没睡，真是不容易啊。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是习惯了，只要罗德岛行驶在荒原上，就什么突发情况都可能会有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"为了确保航线通畅，一个月总有那么几天得半夜离舰紧急施工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，这回有博士在场，提前排查了好几处不稳定结构，这效率提升了不少，我估摸着再有个两三小时，大家就能回舰休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你是不是也很累了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这是我应该做的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"难得出来，就当散散心。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还有Castle-3，你也是大功臣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这一带沙地兽真是多，你不在的话，光是要把它们都赶走，就得多费很多力气啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会遵守指令，保障博士和大家的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你加入工程部门也有三年多了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，距离可露希尔主人第一次启动我升级后的系统，已经过去三年十个月零九天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这么长时间......真是比我们中的很多人都要久了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们准备热点早饭吃，你要不要一起？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"请给我来一碗汤。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不饿，喝点水就好。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，我暂时不需要充电。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从剩余电量来看，本设备还能正常运作八小时十七分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈，本来是想问下你能不能帮忙加热一下冷冻熏肉，毕竟我们平时和Thermal-EX一起行动惯啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，我的型号不支持上述功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......没事，我想到了个别的法子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们谁把剃须刀那家伙的录音机打开了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急啊，我就是想要点热量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那玩意儿年纪可比我们年纪都要大，小心它把我们营地给炸了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这真是录音机？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不是源石爆破物吧？！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......从外壳震动频率来看，该设备的内部电路老化严重，有小概率发生自燃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，需不需要我把目标对象抹除？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不着急。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们离远一点坐吧。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪不朽......不朽......我将成为不朽的怒风......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"快、快摁住它，它是不是要散架啦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪不朽......不朽......我将成为不朽的野火......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"谁来救救我，我的耳朵快给震聋了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威胁解除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的剃须刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，这录音机是彻底坏了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拆除了它的电源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在得到彻底维修之前，我不建议你们继续使用这台设备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"维修......要是真能修好的话，我们早就动手了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"更不用说剃须刀自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"有的东西坏了就是坏了，再怎么想让它继续陪着我们，也留不住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"录音机......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"剃须刀......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，博士，录音机是干员剃须刀的遗物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得剃须刀吗？上次在哥伦比亚，他帮迪伦抢修过“坏家伙”号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候他还好好的，回来之后不久，病情就急转直下，没几天就走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"他才四十多岁......算了，不说这话。只要得了矿石病，谁都想过会有这一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，吃饭......肉还是凉的，不过也没关系，有的吃就不错啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"干了这碗汤吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"敬剃须刀。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不朽......不朽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你这边吃饭边敲碗还唱歌，跟剃须刀学的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"他活得就像他的录音机一样有劲，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......成为一团不朽的野火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪不朽......不朽......我将成为不朽的野火......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，大家在干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家在唱歌。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"大家在思念一位老朋友。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"类似行为，我在陪同干员贾维工作时，也在他身上见过好几次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，博士，我无法掌握这项技能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔主人为我添加的语言模块，让我能理解这些词语的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我并不能体会把这些词语以上述节奏和高低频率表达出来，会和直接说出来有什么差别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家在唱歌。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"重要的是情感的抒发。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不朽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同样不理解这个词语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有什么事物是永不损坏的，哪怕是最坚硬的机器也一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":true,"text":"Castle-3！你是不是在附近了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，贾维兄弟，我和博士和施工队在一起。你们勘测小组是否顺利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺利顺利，我都准备好了......呃，我是说，工作干差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，小爷我啊，忘带扳手了，你过来给我送一下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维兄弟，如果你没有随身携带重要用具，是如何完成工作的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这你就不用管了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，咳，就昨天我们约好的那个事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指昨天说的，你想申请一次长期外勤，并让我陪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对对，不过先别说了，博士还在边上呢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我让Castle-3过来一趟，你没意见吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没意见。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你这表现有点奇怪啊。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，我就知道你一定会批准的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你赶紧过来吧，我在前面等你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我去给贾维兄弟送工具，您更希望留在这里，还是和我一起行动？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一起去吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"正好我也想多走几步。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3还没回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"算算日子时限差不多快到了，说好了他今天要来找我处理一下的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，刚才我问贾维Castle-3在哪里，他怎么表现得奇奇怪怪的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"坏了坏了，他该不会是想偷偷带Castle-3私奔吧？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，能在这一天和您一起行动，Castle-3感到很愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这一天？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你的表现也有点奇怪。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，今天对我来说确实是特别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像刚才干员们说的那样，我已经在罗德岛上工作很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我同型号的作业平台很少能保持运作更长时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我能看到你身上有很多磨损的痕迹。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那些标记......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我注意到您在看我身上的刻痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是否想知道它们的由来？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我想知道。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"早就想问了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些刻痕伴随我走过了这三年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我身上刻下它们的人各不相同，最初那道来自一位年轻的狙击干员。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些该死的强盗，怎么这么多？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......又一个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"想要拿走我身上的资料......没门！咳......咳咳......该死，刚才那一刀一定是伤到了肺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"过......过来......搭把手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建议您躺下休息。虽然我只是一具作战平台，但我也能看出来，您的身体状态已经不适合继续战斗下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"躺下......吗？不，还不到躺下的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，你不介意我在你身上留个标记吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种程度的外壳磨损完全不会影响我的功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不明白您的行为有何意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系......咳咳......Castle-3，其实你也知道，我快死了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果无法立刻得到治疗，您的身体功能将会在三至五个小时内终止运作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"终止运作吗......嗯，没错，对我们人类来说，这就是死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"你想让我躺下来，就这样等着最后一刻到来......我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"这最后的几个小时，我必须坚持下去，做点什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"——你看这些敌人，他们不光抢罗德岛的东西，还一直在骚扰附近的感染者村庄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在我死前，我要干掉他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......第三个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"一道刻痕，一次死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"——这是我用我的命换来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕到了最后关头，这也提醒着我，我的生命和我的死亡，都有意义......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猎弓先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后我背着那位干员冲了出去。很遗憾，在回到罗德岛的时候，他的身体功能还是终止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者使用更确切的词语，他迎来了“死亡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔主人注意到了我身上的刻痕，她本来想帮我去掉，但我更希望留下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"因为你想纪念那位干员？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"因为你想纪念那次事件？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，博士，我同样不能理解“纪念”这个词语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对机器人来说，只要我的核心一天没有损坏，我的记忆库里就会一直记录着那次事件，同样也保存着猎弓先生的所有资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您想知道我为何决定保留这些刻痕，我很难给出一个精确的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔主人提出过一个可能性——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说，我是在“模仿”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在模仿那位干员？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你在模仿刻痕行为？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔主人给我们这些机器都设计了这部分模块，她希望我们的行为举止能更接近人类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我并不能完全理解猎弓先生留下的刻痕的具体意义，但我的程序功能让我决定延续他的行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那次事件之后，我每次外出执行作战任务，都会计数自己击退了多少敌人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并在结束后拜托同行干员，请他们在我的外壳上刻下相应数量的痕迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是在学习。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我不像Thermal-EX，我不会发热，我的程序也并不支持我进行“学习”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到今天，我得出了一个并不确切的结论：猎弓先生留下来的刻痕，可能和剃须刀先生的录音机是类似的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像在本设备不得不停止工作后，我布满刻痕的外壳也许仍然能存在一段时间，无论是在垃圾场，还是在可露希尔主人的私人仓库里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我更希望它留在特殊储物间里。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我会怀念与你一起经历的每一场战斗。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我的核心停止了运作，我记忆库里的数据也会被清除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您今天告诉我的这些话，对我来说有很大意义。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3！你到哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施工队的人越来越近，等他们都到了，事情就麻烦了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，刚才可露希尔发来消息，她问我你是不是跟我在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，我们再不跑就来不及了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维兄弟，我没有明白——什么来不及了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，我听到扳手的声音了。这是否可以说明，其实你并不需要我给你送工具？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是个借口......别管那么多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就听可露希尔说了，你的核心马上就要坏了吧？她是不是打算把你报废了，就跟以前我们厂里报废那些发动机坏了的车一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的意思是，主人是否会在今天停止我的功能的话，确实有这个可能性。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我本应早点向你说明，可我判断，任务是第一优先。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以你主动提出和我一起出来？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以你今天的表现也不太对劲。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到最后一刻，Castle-3都会是您最坚实的伙伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":true,"text":"......那是不是博士的声音？博士为什么也在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，我让你一个人，不是，一个机器自己过来的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士在的话，我怎么带你跑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维兄弟，我昨天就已经对你说过了，让我陪你出长期外勤这个提议，几乎不可能实行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为一台机器，可露希尔主人以及博士的指令是最优先的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我的核心坚持不了多久，你所描绘的我们一起跑好几个国家的情形，是无法实现的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑不了多远，我们也可以跑啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越是命不久矣，就越要及时行乐——在自由奔跑的途中倒下，总比今天就回去，在车间里变成一堆废铁要快乐吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大不了回来之后被奥斯塔唠叨一会，再被可露希尔暴揍一顿......都先不管了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你也说句话啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我觉得贾维说的对。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你怎么想？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通讯完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，Castle-3——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，你怎么突然......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我的传感器侦测到了危险单位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——沙地兽，一共四头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，等您下令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，左边！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距离最近的目标已倒下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，后方岩石背面还有五头沙地兽，正在朝我们靠近！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，攻击左前方三十度的石壁！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岩壁碎裂，博士小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"灾害带来的也不全是麻烦。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，从这裂口出去！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，博士，请坐到我身上来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您一定要坐稳了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，最高速度，前进！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们甩脱那群沙地兽了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，你干得很好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你没有减速。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您先不要下来，只要Castle-3保持当前速度，我们就能在十分钟后抵达本舰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你不去找贾维吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这是自由的反方向。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我听懂了贾维兄弟的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是希望我能在最后的时间里，自由地奔跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们此刻不正在奔跑吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"确实是在奔跑。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"风好大。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，能和您一起奔跑，Castle-3真的非常愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不朽......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这时候好像很适合唱歌。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我将成为不朽的怒风。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将成为不朽的野火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，这又是模仿？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Castle-3，你学会唱歌了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉到了我的轮子碾过荒地，风拍打着我的外壳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有电流通过我的核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您让我感受到了节奏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以为您用电流声伴奏了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"继续奔跑吧，Castle-3。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪我将成为不朽的野火”\n“♪我将成为不朽的怒风”\n“♪从我的肋骨间跑出一群驮兽”\n“♪威风凛凛地冲向荒原”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3......咦，博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔主人，我没有迟到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"没有啊，Castle-3，你一直是最守时的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的主人，从始至终，Castle-3都不会让您失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我跟您去工作间之前，我想再跟博士说几句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题啊，我又不赶时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您选择Castle-3。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与您并肩经历的每一场战斗，都是我的荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，进入休眠模式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"居然自己关机了......博士，今天你们一起做了什么啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们一起完成了一个任务。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们一起经历了一场冒险。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们一起合唱了一首歌。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我也说不上来哪里有些奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3还是Castle-3，不像Lancet-2那样偶尔会说一些伤感的话，也不像Thermal-EX，动不动吓我一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"非要说的话......好像变得更帅气了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或许他学会了“死亡”的概念。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"或许他感到了“生命”的不朽。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"或许他为自己身为机器人的一生感到满意。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我很惊讶，但我说不好是因为你在Castle-3身上看到了这些，还是因为Castle-3竟然让你看到了这些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有什么区别？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"因为偶尔我会有一种感觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"当智能机器人们使用着我们的语言，尝试理解着我们的行为与思想时，我们是不是也在透过他们看自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，突然说这种深沉的话，也太不像我了吧！{@nickname}博士，你真的不考虑和我一起研究智能生命对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不考虑。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"有机会再说吧。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......跟你说完这些，我又有了一些新思路......博士，我带Castle-3回去了啊，今天的工作还挺麻烦的呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"快看看谁来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3，等候您的命令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Castle-3，你没事？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你的记忆库还在吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经运行了三次自我检测程序，没有发现任何记忆文件丢失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那真是太好了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我早就知道可露希尔不会轻易让你报废的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不枉小爷我急急忙忙赶回来......可累坏我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"本来想着能不能多留Castle-3一会，没想到一回来就见他被大卸八块，当时我就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就急了？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"就哭了？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"......就差点朝可露希尔大喊大叫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维兄弟，根据工程部门同事的描述来看，你的行为并不能用“差点”来形容。我记忆库里储存的粗口集锦都不及你的语言丰富......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"够了够了，快别说了，那还不是因为我担心你嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"虽说脑门上给可露希尔揍出来的包还在痛......可小爷我一点都不后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你们几个可是我在岛上认识的最亲的小弟，也就比奥斯塔和布洛卡他们差一点，当然一个都不能少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，贾维兄弟，你也是我的好小弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"这还差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不对啊，谁是谁小弟？Castle-3，你学坏了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么不记得我和可露希尔有改你性格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维兄弟，本设备并不具备“学坏”的功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧行吧，总之，博士，你看到了啊，这家伙刚醒过来就想来找你，让你知道下他没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"结果就是，我们都没闹明白。可露希尔已经准备好了一整套升级系统，可以让Castle-3的核心继续跑个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道能跑多久，说不定比小爷我剩下的时间还要久吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维兄弟，我相信，你也还能自由奔跑很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们会一起陪着博士，而博士也会陪着我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们一起。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不会放手。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，博士，可露希尔主人为我添加了歌曲播放功能，贾维兄弟给我更新了一下曲库，我现在会唱的歌变多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——您想听《火山大喷发之后最伟大的奇观》，还是《你尝起来是这么美味》？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["可露希尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["工程干员B"]},{"speakerId":"char_349_chiave","aliases":["贾维"]}]}
